(Howard:)A little.

4
00:00:09,713 --> 00:00:10,913
(Bernadette:)And it doesn't help

5
00:00:10,914 --> 00:00:12,184
(Bernadette:)that I've got this heightened
sense of smell.

6
00:00:12,182 --> 00:00:14,612
(Penny:)Is that a pregnancy thing?
Yeah.

7
00:00:14,618 --> 00:00:15,748
(Bernadette:)The other day I sniffed out

8
00:00:15,752 --> 00:00:18,482
(Bernadette:)where Howie
hid the Girl Scout cookies.

9
00:00:19,489 --> 00:00:23,889
(Bernadette:)No more Tagalongs, my ass.

10
00:00:23,894 --> 00:00:25,294
(Penny:)But now you'll be able to make

11
00:00:25,295 --> 00:00:28,335
(Penny:)your own milk
to eat the cookies with.

12
00:00:29,633 --> 00:00:31,403
(Raj:)Hey, guys. Hey, Penny.

13
00:00:31,401 --> 00:00:33,331
(Raj:)I really appreciate
you helping me with this.

14
00:00:33,337 --> 00:00:34,667
(Raj:)I don't know what to do.

15
00:00:34,671 --> 00:00:36,571
(Penny:)Oh, sure. Let me see it.
See what?

16
00:00:36,573 --> 00:00:38,643
(Raj:)I hadn't spoken to Emily
since I broke up with her,

17
00:00:38,642 --> 00:00:40,812
(Raj:)and she left this
on my doorstep with a note.

18
00:00:40,811 --> 00:00:44,311
“Raj, I got you this before we
split up, but couldn't return it

19
00:00:44,314 --> 00:00:46,014
“and thought
you'd like to have it.

20
00:00:46,016 --> 00:00:48,186
(Penny:)Happy belated
Valentine's Day, Emily.”

21
00:00:48,185 --> 00:00:49,585
(Attorney:)That's nice.

22
00:00:49,586 --> 00:00:51,616
(Penny:)Nice, or is she trying
to manipulate him?

23
00:00:51,621 --> 00:00:54,191
(Raj:)I know. I mean, do I open it?
Do I return it?

24
00:00:54,191 --> 00:00:55,491
(Amy:)Why wouldn't you open it?

25
00:00:55,492 --> 00:00:56,592
(Raj:)Well, she was pretty mad.

26
00:00:56,593 --> 00:00:58,423
(Raj:)For all I know
it's a voodoo doll of me

27
00:00:58,428 --> 00:01:02,018
(Raj:)with a fork stuck in my junk.

